分发排在插件加载之后，\n否则插件漏订阅。`--replay` / `--no-tdlib` 故意不 attach——回放是离线验证。"},"162":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-38","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"数据流：一条主干，两条回程"},"163":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-39","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"插件的调用经 HostApiVTable 落到 HostRuntime，再翻译成 TdClient 的 send 或 execute；接收循环把回来的东西分成 Update（分发）与 Response（回投）两条路。"},"164":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-40","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"插件"},"165":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-41","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"on / invoke / emit / td_invoke / td_execute / get_config / …"},"166":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-42","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"HostApiVTable"},"167":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-43","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"20 个函数指针，首参一律是 host，全是 Option"},"168":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-44","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"HostRuntime"},"169":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-45","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"翻译成事件总线 / 服务容器 / 工具表 / 中间件管线 / TdClient"},"170":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-46","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"发请求"},"171":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-47","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"同步执行"},"172":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-48","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"TdClient::send"},"173":