"url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`wait_async` 是**一次性** `on(\"update\", ...)` 订阅，命中/超时后自动退订；\n`timeout_ms=0` 表示一直等。"},"712":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"老的 `run()` / `invoke(..., on_response)` 原样保留。"},"713":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"`fuyubot-js-host` 用 `bun` 起的脚本，导入的是 `fuyubot.ts` / `fuyubot.js`："},"714":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"`runAsync` 把原生桥的 stdin 读取放后台线程，但**回调在主线程的 `step()` 里分发**\n（bun 的 JSCallback 不能跨线程调用）；`main` 与 step 循环并行跑。"},"715":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"`invokeAsync` 仍走 `invoke` 的 request/response 配对；`waitAsync` 是一次性\n`on(\"update\", ...)`，超时/命中后自动退订。"},"716":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"老的 `run()` / `invoke(..., onResponse)` 原样保留。"},"717":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景                  | 用什么                   |\n| ------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 同步代码 / 宿主内部 / 登录状态机 | `wait_for_update`（阻塞） |","table":"table-0"},"718":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景                         | 用什么                     |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Rust 插件、有 tokio 等 executor | `ResponseRouter`（await） |","table":"table-0"},"719":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景         | 用什么 