:"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"真 `td_api.tl`：`sendMessage chat_id topic_id reply_to options reply_markup input_message_content`\n——**没有** `message_thread_id` / 顶层 `disable_notification` / 顶层 `caption`（那些是 Bot API 的名字）。\n短名字到 TDLib 字段的映射只有一处实现："},"1666":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-143","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                          | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                    |\n| --------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `topic_id: Some(Topic::forum(n))` | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicForum\",\"forum_topic_id\":n}` |","table":"table-8"},"1667":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-144","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                           | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                        |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `topic_id: Some(Topic::thread(n))` | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":n}` |","table":"table-8"},"1668":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-145","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段              | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                         |\n| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_to_message_id` | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\":\"inputMessageReplyToMessage\",\"message_id\":…}` |","table":"table-8"},"1669":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-146","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段       | 落到的 TDLib 字段                    