` / `react_then` / `unreact_then`）：\n把等待挪到另一个线程，**立刻返回**，结局交给闭包。"},"1674":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-151","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#17-异步版_then","content":"⚠️ 它们返回那个线程的 `JoinHandle`——**插件要在 `stop()` 里 join 掉**，否则动态库卸载之后线程还在跑库里的代码。"},"1675":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-152","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"方法成功时返回的就是 TDLib 原始 JSON（`Value` / `Vec<Value>` / `()`），没有额外包装。\n带状态的返回类型只有 `EntitiesResolution` / `EntityResult` / `FileDownload` 三个（见第 9 节）。"},"1676":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-153","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'SimplifyError::Abi': { description: 'ABI 层出错（宿主没接 TDLib、请求号无效等）。', type: 'AbiError' }, 'SimplifyE…\" />"},"1677":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-154","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"编辑类**刻意不重试**——限流该等多久是调用方的事。"},"1678":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-155","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"封装层额外推的两条事件（不想用就订阅原始 `@type`，两者不冲突）："},"1679":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-156","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"| 事件                  | 谁发                    | 负载                              |\n| ------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `entities_resolved` | `resolve_entities` 末尾 | `EntitiesResolution::to_json()` |","table":"table-9"},"1680":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-157","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"| 事件              | 谁发                                 | 负载                                                                  |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `file_progress` | `download_file` 每收到一条 `updateFile` | `{\"file_id\":…,\"completed\":…,\"downloaded_size\":…,\"expected_size\":…}` |","table":"table-9"},"1681":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-158","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"便捷封装的方法名 / 字段路径是按真 `td_api.tl` 拼的，离线测试拿 `TdApiSchema::check_request`\n逐条校验过（详见开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的第 10 节）；\nMarkdown → entities 的真库行为另有一条 `-- --ignored` 测试。但「真 Telegram 认不认这些值」\n要真账号才验得了。"},"1682":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"page","content":"插件商店","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store"},"1683":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store","content":"配置索引、在 TUI 里安装插件，以及自己维护一个索引"},"1684":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"配置并打开"},"1685":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#发布一个插件给插件作者","content":"发布一个插件（给插件作者）"},"1686":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"维护一个索引（给商城 / 私有源）"},"1687":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#收录到官方商城","content":"收录到官方商城"},"1688":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"安全与限制"},"1689":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store","content":"商店是 TUI 里的一个页面：拉一份静态 `index.json`，搜索、看详情、下载、校验、\n解压、安装、卸载。宿主和插件运行时不会联网。"},"1690":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"在 `fuyubot.toml` 里写索